  <data name="DolbyVisionHint" xml:space="preserve"><value>Profile 8.1 already has an HDR10 base layer. HEVC plays that layer (the TV may show HDR10). Native keeps video/dolby-vision (DV banner). Restart playback. TV default: HDR10.</value></data>
